      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I will immediately frame the conversation around the critical risk to our production lines and the strategic risk of switching to a new supplier for the first production run of the quarter. I will convey that while we are eager to keep things running, the alternative is a costly and risky disruption that will be unacceptable to the board. I will secure the 15% concession while the 24-hour window is still active and draft a \"no show\" agreement for the 24 hours.",
